SPARROWS ATTACK MEN;
MAKE THEM QUIT WORK
DANVILLE Pa., June 21.—Sparrows pecking at the faces and eyes of workmen who were trying to repair the slate roof on the tower of Mahoning Presbyterian Church, forced them to descend and give up the job.

